{"id":"db722cf544a1","path":"/en/university/info/llm/staff-courses","lang":"en","title":"Courses dedicated to USI staff","description":"Keeping language skills up to date is essential for effective communication in an international academic environment. Since the 2023–2024 academic year, the Human Resources Service, as part of the Training and Development programme, has been collaborating with the Laboratory of M","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","LLM","Projects"],"image":null,"words":165,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/llm/corsi-per-lo-staff","en":"/en/university/info/llm/staff-courses"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"LLM","path":null},{"label":"Projects","path":null},{"label":"Courses dedicated to USI staff","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Keeping language skills up to date is essential for effective communication in an international academic environment. Since the 2023–2024 academic year, the <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/organisational-units/408/servizio-risorse-umane\">Human Resources Service</a>, as part of the <em>Training and Development </em>programme, has been collaborating with the Laboratory of Modern Languages to organise and promote English language courses for administrative staff..</p> <p>Over the years, the range of courses has gradually expanded to include levels from beginner to upper-intermediate, meeting the diverse learning needs of participants.</p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>A.Y. 2023/2024</strong></td> <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>A.Y. 2024/2025</strong></td> <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>A.Y. 2025/2026</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td><strong>AS</strong></td> <td><strong>SS</strong></td> <td><strong>AS</strong></td> <td><strong>SS</strong></td> <td><strong>AS</strong></td> <td><strong>SS</strong></td> </tr> <tr> </tr> <tr> </tr> <tr> <td> <p><strong>Lugano<br> Campus</strong></p> </td> <td> <p>B1.2</p> </td> <td> <p>B2.1</p> </td> <td> <ul> <li>B1.1</li> <li>B2.1</li> <li>B2.2</li> </ul> </td> <td> <ul> <li>B1.2</li> <li>B2.2</li> </ul> </td> <td> <ul> <li>B2.1</li> <li>Conversation B2.2</li> </ul> </td> <td> <ul> <li>A2</li> <li>B2.2</li> <li>Conversation B2.2</li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Mendrisio<br> Campus</strong></td> <td> <p>B1.1</p> </td> <td> <p>B1.2</p> </td> <td> <p>B2.1</p> </td> <td> <p>B2.2</p> </td> <td> <p>Conversation B2.2</p> </td> <td> <p>B2</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>With the aim of meeting the current continuing education needs of administrative staff, the Human Resources Service and the LLM are working on the introduction of German language courses, which will further enrich the course offering.</p> <p>For further information, please contact the coordinator of the Training and Development programme, <a href=\"mailto:elena.fontana@usi.ch?subject=Courses%20dedicated%20to%20USI%20staff\">Elena Fontana.</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Laboratory of Modern Languages","href":"/en/universita/info/llm"},{"label":"Administrative team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/administrative-team"},{"label":"Lecturers team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/lecturers-team"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/annual-report"},{"label":"LLM key figures","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/figures"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/universita/info/llm/italiano/docenti"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/satisfaction-italian-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/un